    "updated_at": "2026-06-18T07:18:02Z",
    "body": "**Hi everyone**, it's been a few months since I opened this proposal. I wanted to gently bump this thread to see if any browser implementers have had a chance to look at the accessibility benefits of a native `<type-writer>` element, especially regarding screen readers and progressive enhancement. I'd love to hear your thoughts or any feedback on the live demo!",
