    "updated_at": "2026-06-23T14:54:01Z",
    "body": "Thank you for the guidance, @keithamus ! It makes perfect sense to handle this at the CSS level.\n\nInterestingly, as a Microsoft engineer pointed out in my Chromium report, there is already an active proposal covering this space in the CSS Working Group: [#13689](https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/13689) (opened by @kbabbitt). I will jump into that discussion and cross-reference this WHATWG issue there to highlight the accessibility and structural concerns we discussed. Thanks again for your time!",
